After running the binattse.slurm, a series function will be implemented. It begins with the training of binaural attention model, 
followed by MBSTOI scoring to evaluate its performance. 

The Kiefer-Wolfowitz(KW) algorithm is then employed to approximate gradients based 
on MBSTOI function. Subsequently, the model's output is assessed with MBSTOI again after KW-algorithm. 

Finally,Hearing loss simulation is performed on the model's output and MBSTOI is used to evaluate audio after hearing loss simulation.
All results are saved in folder "resluts"
